      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1908-06-06_WidnesExaminer_art0010" n="art0010">
        <head>Suffering Anremic Girl cured by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills. '</head>
        <p>A Suffering Anremic Girl cured by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills. '</p>
        <p>In almost every family there is one member, ill- endowed by Nature, who seems fated to struggle for life and be the cause of constant anxiety. in the home. At one time Mrs. Boyce., of Farndish Road, Irchester, near Kettering, regarded the saving of her daughter Beatrice as a forlorn hope, fox she was reduced to such a weak state through ALmmia,that she fainted sevei al times daily ; yet Beatrice Bayes is now a bright healthy young woman, every trace of Arremia having been banished by Dr. Williams' Pink Pills for Pale People. " For three years," Miss Bayes stated, " I was so weak and blood- less that I 'fainted time 4 and four times a day ; BEATRICE BAITS, I seemed to be dying for the the girl who was saved by want of llood, for my Dr. Williams' Pink Pilk. flesh wasted away, and I could scarcely move a limb without feeling exhausted. "Often my heart would thump and palpitate unexpectedly, while my hands were always cold, and chilly sensations seized me in the back. It was the same winter or summer ; I was cold, miserable, and without hope. Food I could not enjoy because of the agonies of Indigestion that followed in the shape of severe pains in the chest, headaches and biliousness ; and though I took a lot of physic everybody feared that I could not live." "Indeed, yes," added Mrs. Bayes. "It was not safe to leave her alone." The question was put, " How did you come to try Dr. Williams' Pink Pills ?" "One of my daughters came home," Mrs. Bayes explained, " and when she saw Beatrice she said, 'Lose no time, mother, but give her Dr. Williams' Pink Pills.' " Yes," Miss Bayes added, "and I took them but felt little improvement at first. Then, with the third box I began to lose the terrible weariness and heavy headaches that had afflicted me for three years. Con- tinuing the pills, I could take solid food without fear of Indigestion and my body glowed with warmth. The colour in my cheeks proved that Dr. Williams' Pink Pills had given me New, Good Blood. I never felt better in my life than Ido to-day, but had it not been for Dr. Williams' Pink Pills I should have been in my grave before now." AND TROCSANDS ERY so. Dr. Williams' Pink Pills work wonders upon weak bloodless women and tired nervous men because they fill the starved veins with New, Good Blood in a way achieved by no other medicine. They have cured not only Anmmia, but Nervous Disorders, Neuralgia, St. Vitus' Dance, Rheumatism, Sciatica, Paralysis, and Women's Ills. Only genniale when bearing the seven words, Dr. Williams Pink Pills for Pale People. Sold by dealers or direct from Dr. Williams' Medicine Co., 49, Holborn Viaduct, London, 2s. 9d. for one box, or I3s. 9d. for six boxes post free.</p>
